{"lesson":{"id":"resoudre_fractions_algebriques","title":"Comment résoudre (3x − 2)/4 = (x + 6)/2 sans se mêler dans les dénominateurs","language":"fr","learning_goal":"Résoudre une équation à fractions algébriques en multipliant chaque côté par son dénominateur, puis vérifier la solution."},"math_context":{"symbols":{},"expressions":{}}}
{"slice":{"slice_id":"s_depart","introduces":[{"id":"eq","type":"math","content":"\\frac{3x - 2}{4} = \\frac{x + 6}{2}","parts":[{"id":"gauche","text":"\\frac{3x - 2}{4}"},{"id":"eg","text":"="},{"id":"droite","text":"\\frac{x + 6}{2}"}]}],"beats":[{"id":"presente","say":"Pour éviter de te mêler dans les dénominateurs, on va les faire disparaître dès le départ. Regarde bien l'équation.","cues":[{"id":"c_denom","text":"dénominateurs"}],"do":[{"id":"w_g","verb":"write","target":"eq","part":"gauche","at":"beat:start"},{"id":"w_e","verb":"write","target":"eq","part":"eg","at":"after:w_g"},{"id":"w_d","verb":"write","target":"eq","part":"droite","at":"after:w_e"}]},{"id":"idee","say":"L'idée, c'est de multiplier chaque côté par le dénominateur de ce côté. Ça l'efface sans changer l'égalité.","cues":[{"id":"c_multiplier","text":"multiplier chaque côté"},{"id":"c_efface","text":"efface"}],"do":[{"id":"h_g","verb":"highlight","target":"eq","part":"gauche","role":"accent","start":"cue:c_multiplier","end":"cue_end:c_efface"}]}]}}
{"slice":{"slice_id":"s_gauche","introduces":[{"id":"etape1","type":"math","content":"4 \\times \\frac{3x - 2}{4} = 4 \\times \\frac{x + 6}{2}","parts":[{"id":"m4g","text":"4 \\times \\frac{3x - 2}{4}"},{"id":"m4d","text":"= 4 \\times \\frac{x + 6}{2}"}]},{"id":"etape2","type":"math","content":"3x - 2 = 4 \\times \\frac{x + 6}{2}"}],"beats":[{"id":"multiplie4","say":"Je commence par le côté gauche : je multiplie par quatre en haut et en bas, donc le quatre s'annule.","cues":[{"id":"c_quatre","text":"multiplie par quatre"},{"id":"c_annule","text":"s'annule"}],"do":[{"id":"t1","verb":"transform","source":"eq","target":"etape1","at":"cue:c_quatre"},{"id":"h_m4g","verb":"highlight","target":"etape1","part":"m4g","role":"accent","start":"cue:c_annule","end":"cue_end:c_annule"}]},{"id":"resultat_g","say":"Il me reste trois x moins deux, sans fraction. Je fais la même chose à droite avec le deux.","cues":[{"id":"c_reste","text":"trois x moins deux"},{"id":"c_droite","text":"à droite"}],"do":[{"id":"t2","verb":"transform","source":"etape1","target":"etape2","at":"cue:c_reste"},{"id":"h_m4d","verb":"highlight","target":"etape2","role":"given","start":"cue:c_droite","end":"cue_end:c_droite"}]}]}}
{"slice":{"slice_id":"s_droite","introduces":[{"id":"etape3","type":"math","content":"3x - 2 = 2(x + 6)","parts":[{"id":"g3","text":"3x - 2"},{"id":"d3","text":"= 2(x + 6)"}]},{"id":"etape4","type":"math","content":"3x - 2 = 2x + 12"}],"beats":[{"id":"simplifie","say":"Quatre divisé par deux donne deux, donc à droite il reste deux fois x plus six.","cues":[{"id":"c_quatre_deux","text":"Quatre divisé par deux"},{"id":"c_deux","text":"deux fois x plus six"}],"do":[{"id":"t3","verb":"transform","source":"etape2","target":"etape3","at":"cue:c_quatre_deux"},{"id":"h_d3","verb":"highlight","target":"etape3","part":"d3","role":"accent","start":"cue:c_deux","end":"cue_end:c_deux"}]},{"id":"distribue","say":"Je distribue le deux sur chaque terme : deux fois x donne deux x, et deux fois six donne douze.","cues":[{"id":"c_distribue","text":"distribue"},{"id":"c_douze","text":"douze"}],"do":[{"id":"t4","verb":"transform","source":"etape3","target":"etape4","at":"cue:c_distribue"},{"id":"h_d4","verb":"highlight","target":"etape4","part":"d3","role":"accent","start":"cue:c_douze","end":"cue_end:c_douze"}],"pause_after":"normal"}]}}
{"slice":{"slice_id":"s_isole","introduces":[{"id":"etape5","type":"math","content":"3x - 2x - 2 = 2x + 12 - 2x","parts":[{"id":"op_g","text":"3x - 2x - 2"},{"id":"op_d","text":"= 2x + 12 - 2x"}]},{"id":"etape6","type":"math","content":"x - 2 = 12"},{"id":"etape7","type":"math","content":"x = 14"}],"beats":[{"id":"enleve","say":"Pour regrouper les x à gauche, j'enlève deux x des deux côtés. Je l'écris pour ne rien oublier.","cues":[{"id":"c_enleve","text":"enlève deux x"},{"id":"c_ecris","text":"écris"}],"do":[{"id":"t5","verb":"transform","source":"etape4","target":"etape5","at":"cue:c_enleve"}]},{"id":"simplifie_x","say":"À gauche, trois x moins deux x donne x. À droite, les deux x s'annulent.","cues":[{"id":"c_trois_moins","text":"trois x moins deux x"},{"id":"c_annulent","text":"s'annulent"}],"do":[{"id":"t6","verb":"transform","source":"etape5","target":"etape6","at":"cue:c_trois_moins"}]},{"id":"isole","say":"Il reste x moins deux égale douze. J'ajoute deux des deux côtés, et j'obtiens x égale quatorze.","cues":[{"id":"c_ajoute","text":"ajoute deux"},{"id":"c_quatorze","text":"x égale quatorze"}],"do":[{"id":"t7","verb":"transform","source":"etape6","target":"etape7","at":"cue:c_ajoute"},{"id":"h_x","verb":"highlight","target":"etape7","role":"result","at":"cue:c_quatorze"}],"pause_after":"normal"}]}}
{"slice":{"slice_id":"s_verifie","introduces":[{"id":"verif","type":"math","content":"\\frac{3(14) - 2}{4} = \\frac{14 + 6}{2}","parts":[{"id":"vg","text":"\\frac{3(14) - 2}{4}"},{"id":"ve","text":"="},{"id":"vd","text":"\\frac{14 + 6}{2}"}]},{"id":"verif2","type":"math","content":"\\frac{40}{4} = \\frac{20}{2}"},{"id":"verif3","type":"math","content":"10 = 10"}],"beats":[{"id":"remplace","say":"Je vérifie dans l'équation de départ : je remplace x par quatorze.","cues":[{"id":"c_remplace","text":"remplace x par quatorze"}],"do":[{"id":"d7","verb":"dim","target":"etape7","at":"cue:c_remplace"},{"id":"w_vg","verb":"write","target":"verif","part":"vg","at":"cue:c_remplace"},{"id":"w_ve","verb":"write","target":"verif","part":"ve","at":"after:w_vg"},{"id":"w_vd","verb":"write","target":"verif","part":"vd","at":"after:w_ve"}]},{"id":"calcule","say":"À gauche, trois fois quatorze moins deux donne quarante, sur quatre. À droite, vingt sur deux.","cues":[{"id":"c_gauche","text":"quarante, sur quatre"},{"id":"c_droite_v","text":"vingt sur deux"}],"do":[{"id":"t_v2","verb":"transform","source":"verif","target":"verif2","at":"cue:c_gauche"}]},{"id":"egales","say":"Quarante divisé par quatre fait dix, et vingt divisé par deux fait dix aussi. Les deux côtés sont égaux : ma solution tient.","cues":[{"id":"c_egaux","text":"Les deux côtés sont égaux"}],"do":[{"id":"t_v3","verb":"transform","source":"verif2","target":"verif3","at":"cue:c_egaux"},{"id":"h_v3","verb":"highlight","target":"verif3","role":"result","at":"after:t_v3"}],"pause_after":"long"}]}}
{"slice":{"slice_id":"s_recapitulatif","introduces":[{"id":"regle","type":"math","content":"\\text{Multiplier chaque côté par son dénominateur}","layout":{"to_edge":"left","gap":"lg"}},{"id":"resume","type":"text","content":"x = 14","layout":{"to_edge":"right","gap":"lg"}}],"beats":[{"id":"retenir","say":"À retenir : multiplier chaque côté par son dénominateur efface les fractions d'un coup, puis on isole x et on vérifie.","cues":[{"id":"c_retenir","text":"À retenir"},{"id":"c_efface2","text":"efface les fractions"}],"do":[{"id":"f_verif","verb":"fade_out","target":"verif3","at":"beat:start"},{"id":"cadre","verb":"camera.focus","targets":["regle","resume"],"bounds":"layout_bounds","at":"cue:c_retenir"},{"id":"s_regle","verb":"show","target":"regle","at":"cue:c_retenir"},{"id":"s_res","verb":"show","target":"resume","at":"cue:c_efface2"}]}]}}
